comments.body:
AC amendment (gap-analysis F4): Pin per-branch ProbeResult.evidence schema:
- hard_delete → evidence={}
- trash_restore → evidence={'restored_at_iso': str | None}
- project_move → evidence={'new_project_key': str}
- out_of_window → evidence={'updated_iso': str, 'window_hours': int}

Without this pin, T3's follow-on emitter and audit logs are non-deterministic. Reference: T3 reparent reads `mutation.payload['evidence']['new_project_key']`.
